            "product": "nude-stacked",
            "tag": "Featured product",
            "title": "Nude Stack'd",
            "facts": "<ul><li>A date-night stacking game for two adults. Pull a block, match its symbol to a prompt card, then choose a level: Mild, Spicy or Wild.</li><li>Either player can skip any card, any time.</li><li>In the box: 54 red-painted wooden blocks (37 carry one of six category symbols, 17 are \"?\" mystery blocks), 54 prompt cards with three levels each (162 prompts), a blindfold, a drawstring travel bag and a gift box.</li><li>Six card categories: Body &amp; Play, Firsts &amp; Origins, Attraction &amp; Desire, Dating &amp; Intimacy, Dare &amp; Role Play, Tease &amp; Connect.</li><li>The mystery block: its symbol is on the long side, so you only find out the category once it's pulled.</li><li>Knock the tower over and your partner calls the shots.</li><li>Companion app: scan the QR code in the box for the rules and every card in English, German, Dutch, French, Spanish and Italian.</li><li>Playing time: five minutes to two hours. Age 18+. EAN 5070003166565. Designed in the UK.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
